From a9fd4ce533f1b567688a4ae09570a4f16d0a58e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Kostiw <kostiwj@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Oct 2025 19:23:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: add backported GMSL2 serdes drivers

---
